  "description": "With --omv, the pool as the openmediavault mergerfs plugin's form takes it, and with --json too its omv object: the name from view.mount, which is /srv/mergerfs/<name>, so no warning; each branch a line of paths with its mode, in the order of the line; category.create as the create policy, left out of the options; one minimum free space, here the same on every disk, so view.omv_min_free = \"same\" takes it. --json alone stays as it was, with no omv. With view.engine = \"atoll\", it is the pool that breaks the glass, as the line is, the cache disk included.",
